WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,810
Jianguo, let me introduce it to you.

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,410
Lao Chengtou Seventh Level Han Palace

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:10,410
The old man who gave it to the captain is an old man. Hello, I am Zhang Jianguo and Qi Ye from the same village.

4
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:11,610
Just call me Jianguo and Xiao Zhang

5
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:14,610
Lao Zhang, if you have anything to say, please tell me directly.

6
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:16,810
Jianguo wants to buy a tin boat Xiaobai

7
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:18,810
Someone wants to buy a boat

8
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:24,840
Go and call the factory director over and tell him to run faster and tell him what I said about minor repairs.

9
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,640
This guy can manipulate the factory director at will. Why is he so awesome?

10
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,000
This is the status of a senior machinist

11
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,600
Not to mention in a small shipyard like this

12
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,400
Just in large state-owned factories

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:34,800
Those senior mechanics

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,980
You can also challenge the factory director like this, Master Chen

15
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:44,660
Xiaobai said you asked me, old comrade, what specifications do you want to buy a boat?

16
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:47,260
It's not me who wants to buy a boat, it's him and me.

17
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,860
Just came along to see the excitement

18
00:00:51,950 --> 00:00:54,950
This little comrade wants to buy a tin boat.

19
00:00:55,150 --> 00:00:56,550
You should be no more than thirty years old, right?

20
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:59,750
If you want to buy a tin boat now, you are really young and have no reason to do so.

21
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:01,550
I also squeezed the money out of my teeth.
